1
00:00:00,971 --> 00:00:02,901
(Bill Murray(on screen):)on ESP ability.

2
00:00:02,906 --> 00:00:04,006
(Raj:)Huh.

3
00:00:04,007 --> 00:00:07,177
(Raj:)Bill Murray did get it wrong.

4
00:00:07,177 --> 00:00:09,007
(Howard:)Jump ahead to the Stay Puft
Marshmallow Man.

5
00:00:09,012 --> 00:00:10,712
No!
(Sheldon stammers)

6
00:00:10,714 --> 00:00:12,714
(Howard:)Leonard's right.

7
00:00:12,716 --> 00:00:14,316
(Sheldon:)We can't just jump ahead.

8
00:00:14,318 --> 00:00:16,918
(Sheldon:)We have to watch
the whole movie.
Look.

9
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,090
(Leonard:)We keep procrastinating.

10
00:00:19,089 --> 00:00:20,959
We saw Back to the Future II,

11
00:00:20,957 --> 00:00:22,087
(Leonard:)pigeons playing
ping-pong,

12
00:00:22,092 --> 00:00:23,662
(Leonard:)a bunch of countries
that look like genitals

13
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:26,490
(Leonard:)and one guy whose genitals
look like Denmark!

14
00:00:27,831 --> 00:00:30,531
(Raj:)Yeah, sorry for
clicking on that.

15
00:00:32,569 --> 00:00:34,299
(Leonard:)It's late.
We've wasted hours.

16
00:00:34,304 --> 00:00:36,034
(Leonard:)Can we please find it
in ourselves

17
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:37,909
(Leonard:)to do any amount of work
tonight?

18
00:00:37,908 --> 00:00:41,278
(Sheldon:)But we didn't see them bust
one ghost.

19
00:00:42,979 --> 00:00:45,649
So y-you're saying
we should stand here

20
00:00:45,649 --> 00:00:47,479
(Leonard:)in my lab on a
Saturday night

21
00:00:47,484 --> 00:00:48,614
(Leonard:)and watch the rest
of Ghostbusters

22
00:00:48,618 --> 00:00:50,288
(Leonard:)on a crappy laptop?

23
00:00:50,287 --> 00:00:51,817
(Howard:)No.

